OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAn isolated
OL,6,Fshower or thunderstorm cannot be ruled
OL,7,Fout overnight, but most areas will
OL,8,Fstay entirely dry. There will be areas
OL,9,Fof cloud drifting across, with clear
OL,10,Fspells at times. A warm and humid
OL,11,Fnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FGenerally fine at first with
OL,14,Fsome very warm spells of sunshine
OL,15,Fdeveloping. However, as cloud
OL,16,Fincreases heading into the afternoon
OL,17,Fone or two showers are possible.
OL,18,FFeeling hot and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
